<title>USA: Greenspan ends Senate Humphrey Hawkins testimony.</title>
<headline>Greenspan ends Senate Humphrey Hawkins testimony.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan ended his Humphrey Hawkins testimony on the state of the U.S. economy to the Senate Banking Committee.</p>
<p>Testimony to the House Banking sub-committee has been postponed from Thursday Feb 27 to Wednesday March 5 as Chilean President Eduardo Frei is due to address both houses of Congress tomorrow.</p>
</text>
